    "detailed_description": "<i>Mistmoon Falls</i> is a detective game set in a rustic island town where peace and contentment reign, and everyone sorts their recycling. Or, at least, it might look that way, if you ignore the freshly murdered farmer.<br><br>But as the agent sent to investigate, you <i>mustn\u2019t</i> ignore the murdered farmer. Instead, you must find clues, question the townsfolk, and gather enough evidence to make an arrest. In the meantime, you'll discover Mistmoon Falls harbors more than its fair share of secrets, not to mention denizens more sinister than the Tourist Board has been letting on\u2026<br><br>Work the case however you see fit (this is both a feature and an imperative, detective, 'cuz there's no hand-holding)\u2014just make sure you find out...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684290/extras/cbf05f3b251372ed50e693a095395f3c.webp?t=1676906974\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A bonafide mystery, where progress requires insight: the evidence is there, if you know where to look<br></li><li>An open world town, reminiscent of your favorite farm-life sim<br></li><li>An array of crime-solving tools, including CSI spray, audio bugs, and a metal-detector<br></li><li>Paper trails to follow (fun ones, I promise)<br></li><li>A hypothesis system\u2014express your theories and confront suspects with them<br></li><li>Supranormal goings-on...</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tools of the Trade</h2><br>CSI spray will reveal clues, if you know what you're looking for:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684290/extras/c64a2ec5cd8e3e528c562b66263ddf4f.poster.avif?t=1676906974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684290/extras/c64a2ec5cd8e3e528c562b66263ddf4f.webm?t=1676906974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>The metal detector will... well, detect metal:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684290/extras/e2223dd360b2848e71c2462855d0f7af.poster.avif?t=1676906974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684290/extras/e2223dd360b2848e71c2462855d0f7af.webm?t=1676906974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684290/extras/e2223dd360b2848e71c2462855d0f7af.mp4?t=1676906974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Plant audio bugs and reap valuable forensic data/juicy gossip:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684290/extras/50fd58e9706f1b3ea09190e4e7d61103.poster.avif?t=1676906974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684290/extras/50fd58e9706f1b3ea09190e4e7d61103.webm?t=1676906974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>But nothing beats old-fashioned detective work:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684290/extras/426c63c8cab87db34979ea0a22ecebd2.poster.avif?t=1676906974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684290/extras/426c63c8cab87db34979ea0a22ecebd2.webm?t=1676906974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684290/extras/426c63c8cab87db34979ea0a22ecebd2.mp4?t=1676906974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Accessibility</h2>There are plans to address text readability and other UI concerns. (And if, in fact, you have specific concerns regarding accessibility and the game interests you, please feel free to get in touch).<br><br><br><strong><i>Please note: this game is currently under development, and screenshots reflect a work in progress. Artwork displayed is not final.</i></strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<i>Mistmoon Falls</i> is a detective game set in a rustic island town where peace and contentment reign, and everyone sorts their recycling. Or, at least, it might look that way, if you ignore the freshly murdered farmer.<br><br>But as the agent sent to investigate, you <i>mustn\u2019t</i> ignore the murdered farmer. Instead, you must find clues, question the townsfolk, and gather enough evidence to make an arrest. In the meantime, you'll discover Mistmoon Falls harbors more than its fair share of secrets, not to mention denizens more sinister than the Tourist Board has been letting on\u2026<br><br>Work the case however you see fit (this is both a feature and an imperative, detective, 'cuz there's no hand-holding)\u2014just make sure you find out...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684290/extras/cbf05f3b251372ed50e693a095395f3c.webp?t=1676906974\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A bonafide mystery, where progress requires insight: the evidence is there, if you know where to look<br></li><li>An open world town, reminiscent of your favorite farm-life sim<br></li><li>An array of crime-solving tools, including CSI spray, audio bugs, and a metal-detector<br></li><li>Paper trails to follow (fun ones, I promise)<br></li><li>A hypothesis system\u2014express your theories and confront suspects with them<br></li><li>Supranormal goings-on...</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tools of the Trade</h2><br>CSI spray will reveal clues, if you know what you're looking for:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684290/extras/c64a2ec5cd8e3e528c562b66263ddf4f.poster.avif?t=1676906974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684290/extras/c64a2ec5cd8e3e528c562b66263ddf4f.webm?t=1676906974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>The metal detector will... well, detect metal:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684290/extras/e2223dd360b2848e71c2462855d0f7af.poster.avif?t=1676906974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684290/extras/e2223dd360b2848e71c2462855d0f7af.webm?t=1676906974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684290/extras/e2223dd360b2848e71c2462855d0f7af.mp4?t=1676906974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Plant audio bugs and reap valuable forensic data/juicy gossip:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684290/extras/50fd58e9706f1b3ea09190e4e7d61103.poster.avif?t=1676906974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684290/extras/50fd58e9706f1b3ea09190e4e7d61103.webm?t=1676906974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>But nothing beats old-fashioned detective work:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684290/extras/426c63c8cab87db34979ea0a22ecebd2.poster.avif?t=1676906974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684290/extras/426c63c8cab87db34979ea0a22ecebd2.webm?t=1676906974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684290/extras/426c63c8cab87db34979ea0a22ecebd2.mp4?t=1676906974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Accessibility</h2>There are plans to address text readability and other UI concerns. (And if, in fact, you have specific concerns regarding accessibility and the game interests you, please feel free to get in touch).<br><br><br><strong><i>Please note: this game is currently under development, and screenshots reflect a work in progress. Artwork displayed is not final.</i></strong>",
